      "source": [
        "EDA: Matchup Edges Across Eras\n",
        "\n",
        "The question: Do some teams consistently do better against specific opponents than expected, and does that hold in every era?\n",
        "\n",
        "The data: q1_games_clean.csv, cleaned from FiveThirtyEight's NBA Elo data and\n",
        "NBA regular season, 1979-80 to 2014-15.\n",
        "\n",
        "We follow six questions:\n",
        "1. What does one row mean?\n",
        "2. Is anything missing or broken?\n",
        "3. What does each variable look like on its own?\n",
        "4. How do groups compare?\n",
        "5. Does it change over time?\n",
        "6. What should we ask next?"
      ],
